# PORT-NOTE(dpu_7885): Exynos7885 (Galaxy A30s) display stack. Sibling of
# dpu_9810, NOT a descendant: measured against the 4.4 A30s tree the two DECON
# register headers share only 36.8% of lines with 36 value conflicts, and the
# DPP headers 46.3% / 17 conflicts, so dpu_9810's register blocks cannot be
# reused. Live hardware binds 1x exynos-decon, 1x exynos-dsim, 4x exynos-dpp.
